<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inflammātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		inflammo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a kindling</i>, <i>setting on
			fire</i>, <i>conflagration.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">portarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nazar. in Pan. Constant. 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperium quodam quasi diluvio et inflammatione
					corripuit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					4, 2, 3</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of the body, <i>an
				inflammation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculos inflammatio occupat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					6, 6, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 25, 64, § 132</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">discutere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 20, 86, § 150</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sedare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 25, 74, § 155</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">refrigerare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					24, 8, 35, § 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mitigare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
				23</span></i>
			 prooem. § 3.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a kindling</i>, <i>inflaming</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animorum (poëtarum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 46, 194</span></i>
			.</div>
